### Result
{
  "passkeyRequired": true,
  "operation": {
    "path": "/api/tickets/b15600b3-6803-4ae8-b6ac-d6d8948b78bc/keep",
    "body": {
      "candidateCommit": "b9512392f9285cb039fb00695df0efcd760d668b"
    }
  }
}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('async()=>{const calls=await(await fetch(\'/_requests\')).json();const options=calls.filter(c=>c.path===\'/api/human/options\').at(-1);if(!options?.body.path.endsWith(\'/keep\')||!options.body.body.candidateCommit)throw Error(\'Exact decision not bound\');if(calls.some(c=>c.path.endsWith(\'/keep\')))throw Error(\'Decision bypass\');return {passkeyRequired:true,operation:options.body};}');
```

